Template: cm2/add-to-path
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Add cm2 to PATH automatically?
 Yes (recommended): creates /usr/bin/cm2 so you can type "cm2" in any terminal.
 .
 No: your PATH is left alone. Run /opt/cm2/cm2 directly, or add it yourself,
 e.g.  echo 'export PATH="/opt/cm2:$PATH"' >> ~/.bashrc
